Schema:
Node properties:
Movie {posterEmbedding: LIST, url: STRING, runtime: INTEGER, revenue: INTEGER, budget: INTEGER, plotEmbedding: LIST, imdbRating: FLOAT, released: STRING, countries: LIST, languages: LIST, plot: STRING, imdbVotes: INTEGER, imdbId: STRING, year: INTEGER, poster: STRING, movieId: STRING, tmdbId: STRING, title: STRING}
Genre {name: STRING}
User {userId: STRING, name: STRING}
Actor {url: STRING, name: STRING, tmdbId: STRING, bornIn: STRING, bio: STRING, died: DATE, born: DATE, imdbId: STRING, poster: STRING}
Director {url: STRING, bornIn: STRING, bio: STRING, died: DATE, born: DATE, imdbId: STRING, name: STRING, poster: STRING, tmdbId: STRING}
Person {url: STRING, bornIn: STRING, bio: STRING, died: DATE, born: DATE, imdbId: STRING, name: STRING, poster: STRING, tmdbId: STRING}
Relationship properties:
RATED {rating: FLOAT, timestamp: INTEGER}
ACTED_IN {role: STRING}
DIRECTED {role: STRING}
The relationships:
(:Movie)-[:IN_GENRE]->(:Genre)
(:User)-[:RATED]->(:Movie)
(:Actor)-[:ACTED_IN]->(:Movie)
(:Actor)-[:DIRECTED]->(:Movie)
(:Director)-[:DIRECTED]->(:Movie)
(:Director)-[:ACTED_IN]->(:Movie)
(:Person)-[:ACTED_IN]->(:Movie)
(:Person)-[:DIRECTED]->(:Movie)

Examples from the same database:

Question: "Tom Cruise의 영화는 모두 몇 편인가?"
Cypher: MATCH (:Actor {name: "Tom Cruise"})-[:ACTED_IN]->(m:Movie) RETURN COUNT(m) AS NumberOfMovies

Question: Which 3 directors have directed movies with an imdbRating greater than 8.0?
Cypher: MATCH (d:Director)-[:DIRECTED]->(m:Movie) WHERE m.imdbRating > 8.0 RETURN d.name AS director, collect(m.title) AS movies ORDER BY size(movies) DESC LIMIT 3

Question: What is the average budget of movies that have been considered box office flops?
Cypher: MATCH (m:Movie) WHERE m.revenue < 2 * m.budget WITH avg(m.budget) AS average_budget RETURN average_budget

